sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as FrontEnd
    participant Recommendations
    participant Users
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant LLM as LLM Service

    Note over App,Recommendations: userId comes from the authenticated session. Profile fields and preferences are read from the returned User.

    User->>App: Open Trips
    User->>App: Select Generate recommendations
    App-->>User: Confirm replacement of current recommendations
    User->>App: Confirm generation
    App->>Recommendations: generateRecommendations(userId: string): Promise<Itinerary[]>
    Recommendations->>Users: UserRepository.findUser(userId: string): Promise<User | null>
    Users->>DB: findUser(userId: string): Promise<User | null>
    DB-->>Users: User or null
    Users-->>Recommendations: User or null
    alt user missing or starting location blank
        Note over Recommendations,DB: Previous recommendations remain stored.
        Recommendations-->>App: UserNotFoundError or RecommendationProfileIncompleteError
        App-->>User: Show profile error and offer profile completion or retry
    else profile complete
        Recommendations->>LLM: generateItineraries(startLocation: User.start_location, preferences: User.preferences): Promise<ItineraryDraft[]>
        alt generation service unavailable
            LLM-->>Recommendations: generation error
            Note over Recommendations,DB: Previous recommendations remain stored.
            Recommendations-->>App: generation error
            App-->>User: Show error and allow retry
        else generation service responds
            LLM-->>Recommendations: itineraryJson: unknown
            Recommendations->>Recommendations: parseItineraries(itineraryJson: unknown): Itinerary[]
            alt response does not contain exactly four valid itineraries
                Note over Recommendations,DB: Previous recommendations remain stored.
                Recommendations-->>App: invalid response error
                App-->>User: Show generation error and allow retry
            else response is valid
                Recommendations->>Recommendations: rankItineraries(itineraries: Itinerary[], interest: User.preferences.interest): Itinerary[]
                alt ranking fails
                    Recommendations-->>App: ranking error
                    App-->>User: Show error and allow retry
                else ranking succeeds
                    Recommendations->>DB: replaceLatestRecommendations(userId: string, rankedItineraries: Itinerary[]): Promise<Itinerary[]>
                    alt storage fails
                        DB-->>Recommendations: storage error
                        Recommendations-->>App: storage error
                        App-->>User: Show save error and allow retry
                    else storage succeeds
                        DB-->>Recommendations: Itinerary[]
                        Recommendations-->>App: Itinerary[] sorted by interest similarity
                        App-->>User: Display ranked recommendations with activities and transportation segments
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
